deals pending ( 3 rd quarter ) :
project targetco - purchase of canenerco nol ' s - ca sent friday - c $ 5 mm orig
nug contract mgmt - definitive agreement to be signed by mid july - services to commence august 1 , 2001 - c $ 1 mm orig
project periscope - purchase of tcgs ' aggregator pool - will need to discuss with you further but i think this deal looks probable and fits well - c $ 5 mm
