joe kishkill and orlando gonzales have asked me to discuss this opportunity with you and seek out your interest in representing enron as the chairman of the round table . in the event this is inconvenient for they have suggested greg piper as well . based upon your desire we will advance with securing this opportunity .
i have summarised enron ' s strategic interest below to give you a sense of the nature and importance of the event itself .
enron south american companies in argentina , bolivia , brazil
