the energy and power markets have experienced tremendous price fluctuations over the past few years as well as upheaval in the over - the - counter markets . the need for energy and power professionals to understand derivatives , and to measure and mitigate risk is even greater than ever .
* valuing market risk
* buying and selling forward
* hedging long and short positions
* hedging spreads and basis
* volatility and options
* hedging with options
* hedging with "" exotics ""
* dealing with credit risk
